{"title":"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Marie does three equally time-consuming tasks in a row without taking breaks. She begins the first task at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/e/ebe6787e535eb63b54d667a4d821b52a70f2ca8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\!:\\!00$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> PM and finishes the second task at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/a/c7a55996bd5e5320f6617e3d59c75b9381b0207c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\!:\\!40$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> PM. When does she finish the third task?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/c/58c283952708f3b7549e78e9153f5ac81a0a5360.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\text{3:10 PM}\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\text{3:30 PM}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\text{4:00 PM}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }\\text{4:10 PM}\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }\\text{4:30 PM}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"616\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Marie finishes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> tasks in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hour and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. Therefore, one task should take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes to finish. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/a/c7a55996bd5e5320f6617e3d59c75b9381b0207c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\!:\\!40$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> PM is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/0/2702c918d53a3f5cca5cdfd502579ae52ddb4cf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\!:\\!30$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> PM, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/8/a98e4a6ddca0fede60a9d90c86f479cd7743c570.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }\\text{3:30 PM}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"109\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Wc8feyJcn70\">https://youtu.be/Wc8feyJcn70</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/7CcxOXjv3i8\">https://youtu.be/7CcxOXjv3i8</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-